guide forever/alliance/07-thousand-needles
title Thousand Needles, Duskwood & Wetlands
faction Alliance
levels 28-31
zone Thousand Needles
next forever/alliance/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills

# Duskwood, the Wetlands and the Shimmering Flats, Alliance ~28.2 to ~30.4.
#
# Route from the simulator's consensus Alliance route (Human export, visits
# 11-13: Duskwood 28.2-29.1, Wetlands 29.1-29.6, Thousand Needles
# 29.6-30.4), written out as a playable guide; not play-tested on Forever
# yet.
#
# Flow: fly Stormwind -> Darkshire (hearth) -> the worgen
# of Brightwood and the south, Blind Mary and the Insane Ghoul -> Darkshire
# -> west: Abercrombie, the Plague Spreaders, Sven and the Raven Hill
# Cemetery, the Defias strongbox, the Vul'Gol crate, Abercrombie -> hearth to
# Darkshire -> fly to Menethil Harbor (hearth) -> the Third Fleet's wreck,
# the Bluegill Raiders and the north coast -> Menethil -> the wreck ->
# Menethil -> east: the dig, Sarltooth, the Dragonmaw ->
# Menethil -> the Angerfang Encampment's attack plans -> hearth -> Menethil
# -> boat to Theramore -> the
# Great Lift -> the Shimmering Flats -> hearth to Menethil, where
# 30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills picks up (the Forever Wetlands quests, then
# the boat to Southshore).
#
# Deviations from the export:
# - Look To The Stars (174-177) is turned in on arrival in Darkshire instead
#   of at the end of the visit: Viktori stands on the way, and the Insane
#   Ghoul sits beside the worgen of the south.
# - Apprentice's Duties (471, accepted in the previous guide) is finished on
#   the north coast beside the wreck and turned in here.
# - Henrig Lonebrow's Journal (1100) is picked up at the foot of the Great
#   Lift on the way in (the export takes it at the end of the visit).
# - All Mirage Raceway quests are taken on the first visit; one loop of the
#   flats finishes them all.
# - The Legend of Stalvan (67) is not taken: the export never turns it in
#   (the Old Footlocker is in Westfall).
# - Refresh (2026): Merrick's Bow (96138, Forever, in the new consensus)
#   is optional at the Vul'Gol mound: it starts from Merrick's Bow, which
#   the Lost Watchers of Duskwood drop (rate unknown), asks for 8 Splinter
#   Fist Warriors and 4 Taskmasters and ends at Sirra Von'Indi in Darkshire.
# - Refresh: the guide ends on the hearth to Menethil Harbor; the Southshore
#   boat, flight path, bind and The Shamed Lieutenant (98219) moved to
#   30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills, which first runs the Forever Wetlands
#   quests of the new consensus's 30-31 visit. The new consensus visits
#   Thousand Needles later (32.6, after Hillsbrad); the Shimmering Flats stay
#   here, between the Wetlands and the hearth, as before.
# - Mirage Raceway: Zherin and Pozzik, first on the way in from the salt
#   flats, before Fizzle, Wizzle and Kravel.
# - Forever puts From the Ashes (98221) between War Banners (464) and
#   Nek'rosh's Gambit (465): Captain Stoutfist offers 465 only once 98221 is
#   handed in (issue #225, Lou-Saydus, in game). 98221 is taken when the
#   banners are handed in and done on the trip east that used to light the
#   catapult; 465 is taken when it is handed in after the hearth, and the
#   catapult is lit on the Wetlands loop of 30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills.
#   The Attack Plans are not in the data: the step points at the camp's
#   Tattered Spellbook (671518), the spot the data has inside the camp.
#
# Dropped for flow: A Noble Brew (335, 2450 XP): the Musquash Root sits in
# the far south-east of the Wetlands, a long detour off the route, and the
# Tear of Tilloa another one north of Darkshire. Not accepted in Stormwind
# (06-ashenvale) either; no grind needed for under a tenth of a level.
#
# Class quests: Warlocks hand Devourer of Souls (1716, from Stormwind in
# 04-redridge-mountains) to Takar the Seer on the ride through the Barrens and
# take Heartswood (1738); the Heartswood is in Ashenvale (30-40/02-desolace).
# Warlocks may also take What Is Love? (65602, the incubus) from Takar;
# optional, finished in 30-40/02-desolace and 30-40/05-arathi-highlands
# (forever/class/warlock/incubus-alliance has the whole chain).
#
# Left out (not in the export): Bride of the Embalmer (253: elites), The
# Weathered Grave (225: elite Mor'Ladim), Defeat Nek'rosh (474: elite).
# Checked and skipped: The Scythe of Elune (1043) needs The Carevin Family
# (1041, 1042), a chain from Darkshore and Ashenvale the route never starts.
# Keeping Pace and Rizzle's Schematics (1190, 1194) need News for Fizzle
# (1137), which comes after Martek in the Badlands at 38.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Darkshire

step Darkshire
  zone Duskwood
  tip No Bronze Tube for Look to the Stars? Herble Baubbletump sells it in the house beside Viktori, in limited stock; Neal Allen in Menethil Harbor sells it too.
  fly "Darkshire"                         -- From Dungar Longdrink in Stormwind
  sethome "Darkshire" npc 6790            -- Innkeeper Trelayne, Scarlet Raven Tavern
  turnin 1243                             -- Watcher Backus, at the north entrance of town
  accept 1244
  accept 66                               -- Madame Eva
  turnin 66                               -- Clerk Daltry, in the town hall
  accept 58                               -- Commander Althea Ebonlocke
  accept 173                              -- Calor, by the town hall
  buy 4371 x1 npc 3133 optional           -- Bronze Tube, from Herble Baubbletump, if you have none
  turnin 174                              -- Viktori Prism'Antras, at the east end of town
  accept 175

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Worgen

step Nightbane Shadow Weavers
  tip The worgen hold the woods of Brightwood, west of Darkshire and north of the road. Pull them one at a time.
  kill 533 quest 173                      -- Nightbane Shadow Weaver

step Calor
  turnin 173
  accept 221

step Nightbane Dark Runners
  tip The Dark Runners prowl the woods south of the road, west of Darkshire.
  kill 205 quest 221                      -- Nightbane Dark Runner

step Calor
  turnin 221
  accept 222

step Blind Mary
  tip Her house stands on the hill south-east of Darkshire.
  turnin 175
  accept 177

step Nightbane Vile Fangs and the Insane Ghoul
  tip The strongest worgen roam the woods south of Darkshire, west and south of the Tranquil Gardens Cemetery. The Insane Ghoul hides in the small crypt by the cemetery.
  kill 206 quest 222                      -- Nightbane Vile Fang
  kill 920 quest 222                      -- Nightbane Tainted One
  collect 1946 quest 177                  -- Mary's Looking Glass

step Darkshire
  turnin 177                              -- Viktori Prism'Antras
  turnin 222                              -- Calor
  accept 223
  turnin 223                              -- Jonathan Carevin, by Elaine Carevin's house
  vendor nearest

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- West

step Abercrombie
  tip Ride west along the road; the hermit's shack stands north-east of the Raven Hill Cemetery.
  accept 134

step Plague Spreaders
  tip The Plague Spreaders walk the northern half of the Raven Hill Cemetery. Mor'Ladim, an elite, wanders the graves: keep away from him.
  kill 604 quest 58                       -- Plague Spreader

step Sven's Camp
  accept 323                              -- Sven Yorgen

step Raven Hill Cemetery, west
  tip Skeletal Raiders, Healers and Warders hold the west part of the cemetery, just east of Sven's camp.
  kill 1110 quest 323                     -- Skeletal Raider
  kill 787 quest 323                      -- Skeletal Healer
  kill 785 quest 323                      -- Skeletal Warder

step Sven's Camp
  turnin 323                              -- Sven Yorgen
  accept 269                              -- For Bishop Farthing in Stormwind, in the next guide

step Defias Strongbox
  tip The Defias camp lies in the south-west of Duskwood, south of Raven Hill near the Westfall border. The strongbox stands among the tents.
  collect 5947 quest 1244 @23.9,72.1      -- Defias Docket

step Vul'Gol Ogre Mound
  tip Ride east to the ogre mound. Abercrombie's Crate sits in the camp at its entrance; Splinter Fist ogres guard it.
  collect 1349 quest 134 @33.4,76.3       -- Abercrombie's Crate
  accept 96138 optional                   -- Only if a Lost Watcher dropped Merrick's Bow: right-click it
  kill 212 x8 quest 96138.1 optional      -- Splinter Fist Warrior
  kill 892 x4 quest 96138.2 optional      -- Splinter Fist Taskmaster

step Abercrombie
  turnin 134
  accept 160

step Back to Darkshire
  hearth "Darkshire"
  turnin 1244                             -- Watcher Backus
  accept 1245                             -- For Elling Trias in Stormwind, in the next guide
  turnin 58                               -- Commander Althea Ebonlocke
  turnin 160                              -- Lord Ello Ebonlocke, in the town hall
  accept 251
  turnin 251                              -- Sirra Von'Indi, in the house behind the town hall
  accept 401
  turnin 401                              -- Wait a moment, then speak with her again
  accept 252
  turnin 252                              -- Lord Ello Ebonlocke
  turnin 96138 optional                   -- Sirra Von'Indi

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Menethil Harbor

step Menethil Harbor
  zone Wetlands
  fly "Menethil Harbor"                   -- Felicia Maline
  sethome "Deepwater Tavern" npc 1464     -- Innkeeper Helbrek
  accept 288                              -- First Mate Fitzsimmons, in the inn
  buy 2594 x1 npc 1464                    -- Flagon of Mead, from Innkeeper Helbrek
  turnin 288
  accept 289
  accept 526                              -- Glorin Steelbrow, upstairs in the inn
  accept 464                              -- Captain Stoutfist, by the keep

step The wreck of the Third Fleet
  tip Follow the coast north to the wrecked ship. Cursed Sailors walk the beach, Cursed Marines the deck; First Mate Snellig stands on the beach by the bow. Giant Wetlands Crocolisks lurk on the coast just north of it.
  kill 1157 quest 289                     -- Cursed Sailor
  kill 1158 quest 289                     -- Cursed Marine
  collect 3619 quest 289                  -- Snellig's Snuffbox: First Mate Snellig
  collect 3348 quest 471                  -- Giant Crocolisk Skin

step Bluegill Raiders
  tip Follow the coast north-east past the wreck: the Bluegill Raiders hold the marsh beyond the Giant Crocolisks.
  collect 2702 quest 526                  -- Lightforge Ingot

step Menethil Harbor
  turnin 526                              -- Glorin Steelbrow
  turnin 289                              -- First Mate Fitzsimmons
  accept 290
  turnin 471                              -- James Halloran
  vendor nearest

step Captain Halyndor
  tip The captain walks the deck of the wrecked ship; his strongbox sits in the hold.
  collect 2629 quest 290                  -- Intrepid Strongbox Key
  turnin 290                              -- Intrepid's Locked Strongbox
  accept 292

step Glorin Steelbrow
  turnin 292
  accept 293                              -- For Archbishop Benedictus in Stormwind, in the next guide

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- East Wetlands

step Whelgar's Excavation Site
  tip Follow the road east to the excavation site.
  accept 299                              -- Prospector Whelgar
  accept 296                              -- Ormer Ironbraid

step The dig and Sarltooth
  tip The relics lie in the dig itself. Sarltooth, a big Razormaw, prowls the raptor valley just west of it.
  collect 2658 quest 299                  -- Ados Fragment
  collect 2659 quest 299                  -- Modr Fragment
  collect 2660 quest 299                  -- Golm Fragment
  collect 2661 quest 299                  -- Neru Fragment: the Loose Soil
  collect 3638 quest 296                  -- Sarltooth's Talon

step Ormer and Whelgar
  turnin 296                              -- Ormer Ironbraid
  turnin 299                              -- Prospector Whelgar

step Dragonmaw camp
  tip The Dragonmaw orcs camp east of the excavation site. Raiders and Swamprunners carry the war banners.
  collect 3337 quest 464                  -- Dragonmaw War Banner

step Captain Stoutfist
  tip Ride back west along the road to Menethil Harbor.
  turnin 464
  accept 98221                            -- From the Ashes: Nek'rosh's Gambit comes after it on Forever

step Angerfang Encampment
  tip Ride east again to the Dragonmaw camp. The four sets of Attack Plans lie in the Angerfang Encampment; Chieftain Nek'rosh, an elite, stands in the camp too.
  complete 98221 @53.5,54.5

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Thousand Needles

step To Theramore
  hearth "Deepwater Tavern"
  turnin 98221                            -- Captain Stoutfist, in Menethil Keep
  accept 465                              -- For the Dragonmaw catapult, on the Wetlands loop of the next guide
  note Take the boat from Menethil's pier to Theramore Isle in Dustwallow Marsh.

step Takar the Seer
  only Warlock
  zone The Barrens
  tip On the road south through the Barrens, Takar the Seer camps east of the road, north-east of Camp Taurajo; come in from the east and keep clear of the Horde guards.
  turnin 1716                             -- Takar the Seer
  accept 1738                             -- Heartswood: in Ashenvale, on the way to Desolace
  accept 65602 optional                   -- What Is Love?: the incubus, beside the succubus; the Wooden Figurine is near the Heartswood

step The Great Lift
  zone Thousand Needles
  tip From Theramore follow the road west out of Dustwallow into the Barrens and south along it; give Camp Taurajo a wide berth. The Great Lift at the Barrens' south end takes you down into Thousand Needles. The journal lies at the foot of the lift.
  collect 5791 @30.7,24.3                 -- Henrig Lonebrow's Journal
  accept 1100                             -- For Falfindel Waywarder in Feralas, much later

step Mirage Raceway
  tip Follow the canyons east to the salt flats. The goblins and gnomes of the Mirage Raceway are neutral and give quests to both factions.
  accept 1104                             -- Fizzle Brassbolts
  turnin 1179                             -- Wizzle Brassbolts
  accept 1105
  accept 1110                             -- Kravel Koalbeard
  accept 5762                             -- For Hemet Nesingwary in Stranglethorn, later
  accept 1176                             -- Pozzik
  accept 1175                             -- Trackmaster Zherin

step The salt flats
  tip Rocket Car Rubble lies all over the flats. Scorpid Reavers, Sparkleshell Tortoises and Saltstone Basilisks roam the north half, Crystalhides, Scorpid Terrors and Snappers the middle, and the Gazers (34-35, five levels above you: one at a time) the far south. Vultures circle over all of it.
  collect 5798 quest 1110                 -- Rocket Car Parts
  collect 5794 quest 1104                 -- Salty Scorpid Venom
  collect 5795 quest 1105                 -- Hardened Tortoise Shell
  collect 5848 quest 1176                 -- Hollow Vulture Bone
  kill 4147 quest 1175                    -- Saltstone Basilisk
  kill 4151 quest 1175                    -- Saltstone Crystalhide
  kill 4150 quest 1175                    -- Saltstone Gazer

step Mirage Raceway
  turnin 1175                             -- Trackmaster Zherin
  turnin 1176                             -- Pozzik
  turnin 1104                             -- Fizzle Brassbolts
  turnin 1105                             -- Wizzle Brassbolts
  accept 1106                             -- Fizzle Brassbolts: for Martek in the Badlands, later
  turnin 1110                             -- Kravel Koalbeard

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Back to Menethil

step Back to Menethil
  zone Wetlands
  hearth "Deepwater Tavern"
